## Pattern 10: Message gửi tin nhắn (Idempotency)

```java
// Trong ChatService
@Transactional
public MessageResponse sendMessage(UUID senderId, UUID channelId, SendMessageRequest req) {
    // Idempotency check: nếu clientMessageId đã tồn tại → trả message cũ
    if (req.clientMessageId() != null) {
        Optional<Message> existing = messageRepository
            .findBySenderIdAndClientMessageId(senderId, req.clientMessageId());
        if (existing.isPresent()) {
            return MessageResponse.from(existing.get());
        }
    }

    // Tạo message mới
    Message message = new Message();
    message.setChannelId(channelId);
    message.setSenderId(senderId);
    message.setContent(req.content());
    message.setImageUrl(req.imageUrl());
    message.setClientMessageId(req.clientMessageId());
    message = messageRepository.save(message);

    return MessageResponse.from(message);
}
// Sau khi return → controller gọi eventPublisher.publish(MESSAGE_CREATED, ...)
```

