## Mapping: Frontend Screen → Backend Module

| Frontend Screen | Backend Module | Key Endpoints |
|---|---|---|
| LoginScreen | auth | `POST /api/auth/login` |
| RegisterScreen | auth | `POST /api/auth/register` |
| SetupProfileScreen | user | `PUT /api/users/me/profile`, `POST /api/users/me/game-profile` |
| HomeScreen | game, team | `GET /api/games/popular`, `GET /api/teams/recruiting` |
| ExploreScreen | team, explore | `GET /api/teams/open`, `GET /api/players/online` |
| CreateRequestScreen | team | `POST /api/team-requests` |
| TeamScreen (Nhóm tab) | team | `POST /api/teams`, `GET /api/teams/my` |
| TeamScreen (Yêu cầu tab) | team | `GET /api/teams/my/join-requests`, `POST .../accept` |
| TeamScreen (Cộng đồng tab) | community | `GET /api/communities` |
| CommunityChatScreen | chat | `GET/POST .../messages` |
| NotificationScreen | notification | `GET /api/notifications` |
| ProfileScreen | user | `GET /api/users/me/profile` |
